---
Versi terpasang : 1.0.0
Versi terbaru   : v1.4.0

Pembaruan tersedia.

Cara memperbarui (Debian/Ubuntu, paket .deb):
  curl -LO https://github.com/teguh02/Indonesiaku-Lang/releases/download/v1.4.0/indonesiaku_1.4.0_amd64.deb
  sudo dpkg -i indonesiaku_1.4.0_amd64.deb

Distribusi lain (tanpa dpkg):
  curl -LO https://github.com/teguh02/Indonesiaku-Lang/releases/download/v1.4.0/indk-linux.tar.gz
  tar -xzf indk-linux.tar.gz

Tidak perlu menghapus versi lama; paket baru menimpa yang lama.
